Z||000005||RNGCRSH||01-02-2001||08:54 PM||||I just got a Ryane bump steer kit off of E-bay. Bought it from Chris Moore. He said that it is 1000% better than the RCC kit. Its not that much more  expencive when you consider that it replaces the tie rods, ball joint and control arm. I am sure Held Motorsports will be making this product.||||reg||1
Z||000006||tgowens||01-02-2001||10:28 PM||||we (the Fiero Shop of Richmond, CA) will soon be offering a bump-steer kit which is much lighter than Rayne's (according to Ed Parks of the Fiero Factory) - we are in the process of assembling the components and will have photos of the kit soon. This is for the rear of the '84 - '87 models only.||||reg||1
