Z||000009||afRaceR||01-04-2001||10:48 PM||||Batboy, does the bumpsteer kit mount in the stock location on the cradle? If it does, how will that improve the situation any?<BR>How much does the kit bumpsteer kit and coilovers cost from RCC?<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000010||tgowens||01-05-2001||02:45 AM||||Lucky, we will certainly let you know - the parts are at the machine shop now and we should have the finished product by early next week. This will be a totally different bump-steer kit from the RCC product inasmuch as the Fiero Shop kit will <I>eliminate</I> the bump-steer effect rather than just <I>minimize</I> it. And, the beauty of it all is that it will work with stock struts, stock wheels, stock tires, stock suspensions.........this kit will be for the '84-87 models and will fit all models of those years............price? Not sure yet but we'll announce it along with the photos of the kit early next week......||||reg||1
Z||000011||batboy||01-05-2001||12:01 PM||||Yes, the RCC bump steer correction kits are an easy bolt-in that mounts in the factory location. That pic I posted shows the outer tie rods installed, but I think I had to buy them separately.<P>Tgowens is right, the RCC don't completely eliminate bump steer, especially at both extremes of suspension travel. However, it does nearly completely eliminate it while in the normal range of suspension travel.||||reg||1
Z||000012||Verticalspeed||01-06-2001||01:50 PM||||Will you make enough of them so that there are no 3-4 week waiting period like most of the other suspension performance parts?<BR>Nothing like sending your money in for a product and waiting the whole summer to receive it! Been there done that.||||reg||8
Z||000013||tgowens||01-06-2001||09:49 PM||||batboy, the purpose of an anti-bump-steer kit is to eliminate bump steer at <B>all</B> ranges of suspension travel since the suspension is normally moving in a vertical and horizontal plane at the same time. We fel that ours accomplishes this.<P>Verticlespeed, we will be stocking the product in order that we may ship within two business days of an order. We accept all major credit cards and ship UPS ground normally. Other shipping methods may be used such as second day air if needed. ||||reg||1
